### Cadastrar um plano
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Básico",
    "price": 29.90
}

### Cadastrar outro plano
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pro",
    "price": 59.90
}

### Cadastrar mais um plano
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Premium",
    "price": 99.90
}

### Listar todos os planos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/plans

### Consultar um plano pelo id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/plans/1

### Atualizar um plano
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/plans/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Básico Plus",
    "price": 39.90
}

### Excluir um plano
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/plans/3
